      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "Fixed to change with show/hide of style instead of add/remove. Show/hide didn't work well with an earlier format of the toolbar, it works pretty well now with just a little bit of a funky background element in the bar.\nWe unfortunately can't do `myVE.style.display = DisplayStyle.None` which hides the elements and collapses their space, since that's not available until 2019. So instead we'll set their visibility to 'hidden', so they take up their same space but aren't visible or clickable.",
