  "details": "When UdonGraphWindow is opened from the menu (VRChat SDK > Udon Graph), \"Settings\" is shown.\nIf you press \"Welcome\" then \"Settings\" is hidden. so I guess you intend it is related graph asset.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.18.16.59_Closed_Community_Test\n--- NOTES\n* If you click this Settings, NullReferenceException occurs. Because _graphView is null and he function binded on _toolbarOptions accesses it.\n* BTW, you Add and Remove elements in ShowGraphTools. In this sort of cases, isn't it better to control USS styles ? https://forum.unity.com/threads/is-this-the-correct-approach-for-this-type-of-custom-editor-window.782438/#post-5211878",
